  "title": "Cornish Game Hens with Garlic and Rosemary",
  "description": "These roasted Cornish hens flavored with garlic, lemon, and fresh rosemary are tender and juicy. Perfect for a simple yet elegant Thanksgiving meal.",
  "authors": [
